## 💡 BONUS: "Single Source of Truth 2.0"
Suggesting a **Rule-Driven Calculator Engine**:
Instead of writing TypeScript functions for every tool, define the "Formula Chain" in JSON. This ensures that if a step is updated (e.g. adding a new tax), it reflects in ALL tools using that chain automatically.
